[00:00.00] 作曲 : Eliza Shaddad/Grace Chatto/Jack Patterson
[00:00.00][by:陈子一枚]
[00:01.00] 指挥家 : Richard Davis
[00:02.00] 作词 : Eliza Shaddad/Grace Chatto/Jack Patterson
[00:47.34]January always brings a fear of creatures
[00:47.34]一月会带来许多的恐惧
[00:50.36]Strong-holdings and salt in places yet to heal
[00:50.36]强压和盐同时施加于伤口
[00:53.55]Crying at the site of strings
[00:53.55]在琴弦上无助的哭泣
[00:55.68]She was there when they came for you
[00:55.68]当负面情绪来临 她总会在你身边
[00:57.76]A great man and the child in you
[00:57.76]你是伟人 也是个小孩
[00:59.85]Enough when I take you far from here
[00:59.85]当我带你离开这里足够远的时候
[01:02.00]Enough to cut a morning view
[01:02.00]远到看不见朝霞的时候
[01:21.07]Strange how a sound could change your feelings
[01:21.07]一个陌生的声音可能会改变你的感受
[01:25.17]Staring wide and dirty breathing
[01:25.17]双眼圆睁 呼吸浑浊
[01:29.36]I remember how a calling came in
[01:29.36]我记得那个拔入的电话
[01:33.59]Scared of deceiving and all I could hear was run
[01:33.59]害怕欺骗 听到的只是逃离
[03:02.39]The fire
[03:02.39]熊熊烈火
[03:10.36]The fire
[03:10.36]熊熊烈火
[03:18.97]January always brings a fear of creatures
[03:18.97]一月会带来许多生物的恐惧
[03:21.97]Strong-holdings and salt in places yet to heal
[03:21.97]重压和盐同时施加于伤口
[03:25.14]Crying at the site of strings
[03:25.14]在琴弦上无助哭泣
[03:27.25]She was there when they came for you
[03:27.25]当这些负面情绪来临 她永远在那里
[03:29.38]A great man and the child in you
[03:29.38]你是一个伟人 也是一个小孩
[03:31.35]Enough when I take you far from here
[03:31.35]我要带你逃离这里足够远
[03:33.41]Enough to cut a morning view
[03:33.41]远到看不见朝霞
